    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Asiriya neesingura Misiri n'Esopiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka engabwa eyatumirwe Sarutaani omukama w'Asiriya ogu yahikiiremu omu rubuga Asidoodi akarurwanisa kandi akaruhamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kasumi ako, MUKAMA akaba agambiire Isaaya mutabani w'Amozi ati: “Genda ojuulemu eguniya ei ojwaire omunda oihe n'enkaito omu maguru;” Isaaya nukwo yakozire, yatandika kugenda busa kandi atajwaire nkaito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagamba ati: “Omuheereza wange Isirairi, nkooku yamazire emyaka esatu naagenda busa kandi atajwaire nkaito, ako kali karorwaho kandi kirango ekirukuranga ebikaba nibiija kugwera Misiri n'Esopiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA w'Asiriya, na uwe nukwo araayebembera abanyagwa Abanyamisiri na Abesopiya abaazaahisibwe, abato n'abakuru, abatwale ali busa kandi atajwaire nkaito; ha kibunu ateenagireho kantu ahemule Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho abantu abaayesigaga Esopiya kandi abaayehulizibwaga Misiri balihwa amaani kandi basoberwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, enzaarwa eza ha mukungu ogw'enyanja egi, baligamba bati: ‘Kinu nikyo kigweriire abo aba twayesigaga kandi aba twayebingire batukoonyere, batujune omukama w'Asiriya! Lero itwe, turaatabuka tuta?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
